Let me do that calculation. 15 divided by 5 equals 3. So that would mean they need 3 vans. Wait, but let me make sure I didn't miss anything. 

Is there any chance that the vans can't be partially filled? Like, if they have 15 people and each van holds 5, then 3 vans would exactly fit all the people. Because 3 times 5 is 15. So that's perfect. 

