$$

---

### Step 2: Calculate the remaining flour needed

Each brownie requires 8 cups of flour, so for the remaining 9 brownies:

$$
9 \times 8 = 72 \text{ cups of flour}
$$

---

### Final Answer

$$
\boxed{72}
$$

