Okay, let's see. The problem is about Luke selling his games. He started with 39 games. Then he sold 19 of them. So first, I need to figure out how many games he has left after selling 19. To do that, I subtract 19 from 39. Let me do that calculation: 39 minus 19. Hmm, 39 minus 10 is 29, then minus 9 more is 20. So he has 20 games left. 

