2. **Determine Weekly Expenditure**:  
   Mike spends $5 per week.

3. **Calculate Duration the Money Will Last**:  
   Divide the total earnings by the weekly expenditure:  
   $$
   40 \div 5 = 8
   $$  
   This means the money will last for 8 weeks.

