Alternatively, maybe I can calculate the total hours first. 8 hours on Monday and 2 hours on Tuesday. 8 + 2 is 10 hours total. Then 10 hours times $8 is $80. Yep, same answer. So that confirms it. So Will made $80 in total over the two days. I think that's correct. No errors in the calculation. The answer should be 80.
